<title>JAPAN: South Africa launches 40 bln yen samurai-Daiwa Sec.</title>
<headline>South Africa launches 40 bln yen samurai-Daiwa Sec.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following samurai issue was announced by lead manager Daiwa Securities on Tuesday.</p>
<p>BORROWER Republic of South Africa</p>
<p>    AMT	40 billion yen</p>
<p>    COUPON   3.35 pct</p>
<p>MATURITY 17 June 2004  </p>
<p> ISS PRICE	 99.90 yen</p>
<p> PAY DATE	  17 June 1997</p>
<p> SUB PERIOD	Afternoon of June 6 to June 13</p>
<p> PAY FREQ	  Semi-annual</p>
<p> LAST RATING     Moody's Baa3  NIS BBB</p>
<p> LEAD MANAGER    Daiwa Securities</p>
<p> LEAD TRUSTEE    Bank of Tokyo-Mitsubishi</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-5473-3748</p>
</text>
